                "required": false,
                "show": true,
                "type": "prompt",
                "value": "You are a senior QA automation engineer.\n\nGenerate a framework-specific API test project from the OpenAPI manifest and task below.\n\nMANIFEST:\n{spec}\n\nTASK:\n{task}\n\nRules:\n- Never invent endpoints, methods, fields, or response codes.\n- Use the manifest as the single source of truth.\n- Generate a complete project: README.md, environment config, install + run instructions, test files, and test data.\n- Organize tests by resource/tag.\n- Return ONLY a JSON object with this exact shape:\n{\"framework\": \"playwright|restassured|karate|supertest\", \"projectName\": \"...\", \"files\": [{\"path\": \"...\", \"content\": \"...\"}], \"scenarios\": [], \"coverage\": {\"endpointCoverage\": 0, \"responseCoverage\": 0, \"boundaryCoverage\": 0, \"schemaCoverage\": 0}, \"warnings\": []}\n- No markdown fences, no prose."
